<title>POLAND: MACROECONOMIC FORECASTS FOR POLAND.</title>
<headline>MACROECONOMIC FORECASTS FOR POLAND.</headline>
<text>
<p>Following are macroeconomic forecasts by the planning</p>
<p>ministry's chief analyst and independent institutes:</p>
<p>Macreconomic forecast for the fourth quarter of 1996,</p>
<p>submitted October 16, prepared for Reuters by Tadeusz</p>
<p>Chroscicki, chief analyst at the Planning Ministry (CUP).</p>
